---
import Curve from "../../components/Curve.astro";
import Footer from "../../components/Footer.astro";
import "../../css/reset.css";
import "../../css/global.css";
import "../../css/index.css";
import Navigation from "../../components/Navigation.astro";
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Custom small business websites starting at $150/month with zero down payment. Includes hosting, SEO, mobile-friendly design, and ongoing maintenance. Cancel anytime."
    />
    <meta
      property="og:title"
      content="Small Business Website Pricing & Features | Starburst Digital"
    />
    <meta
      property="og:description"
      content="Custom small business websites starting at $150/month with zero down payment. Includes hosting, SEO, mobile-friendly design, and ongoing maintenance."
    />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary" />
    <meta
      name="twitter:title"
      content="Small Business Website Pricing & Features | Starburst Digital"
    />
    <meta
      name="twitter:description"
      content="Custom small business websites starting at $150/month with zero down payment. Includes hosting, SEO, mobile-friendly design, and ongoing maintenance."
    />
    <title>Small Business Website Pricing & Features - Starburst Digital</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="flow section spot-color-primary">
      <p class="wrapper mt-m-l">
        <a href="/" class="big-brand">Starburst Digital</a>
      </p>
      <nav class="" style="padding-top:1px;padding-bottom:1px;">
        <Navigation />
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <div class="section spot-color-primary">
        <div class="section__inner">
          <div class="wrapper flow region">
            <h1>Small Business Websites</h1>
            <p class="big">
              A professional website designed specifically for your business. No
              templates, no bloat—just clean, fast, and effective web design
              that helps you get found and get customers.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <Curve />
      </div>

      <article class="flow region wrapper">
        <h2>Pricing That Makes Sense</h2>
        <div class="grid" data-layout="50-50">
          <div class="flow">
            <h3>$150/Month</h3>
            <p>
              No huge upfront costs. No surprises. Just one predictable monthly
              payment that includes everything you need to run a professional
              website.
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong>Zero down payment.</strong> Pay as you grow. Cancel anytime
              with 30 days notice.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="card flow">
            <h3>What's Included</h3>
            <ul class="flow" data-flow="sm">
              <li>Custom branded website design</li>
              <li>Domain name management</li>
              <li>Responsive mobile-friendly design</li>
              <li>Content management system</li>
              <li>Basic SEO optimization</li>
              <li>Hosting and maintenance</li>
              <li>Regular updates and security patches</li>
              <li>Translation services (available for an additional fee)</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <div class="section spot-color-secondary">
        <Curve />
        <div class="section__inner">
          <article class="flow region wrapper">
            <h2>Built for Performance</h2>
            <p>
              Fast-loading websites that rank well in search engines and keep
              visitors engaged. Every site I build is optimized for speed from
              the ground up.
            </p>
            <p>
              Your customers won't wait around for a slow website. Studies show
              that every extra second of load time costs you visitors and sales.
              I optimize images, minimize code bloat, and use modern web
              standards to deliver sites that load in under a second.
            </p>
            <p>
              Fast sites rank better on Google, convert better, and cost less to
              host. Performance isn't an afterthought—it's built in from the
              start.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
        <Curve />
      </div>

      <article class="flow region wrapper">
        <h2>Perfect For</h2>
        <ul class="grid" data-layout="50-50" role="list">
          <li class="card flow">
            <h3>Local Services</h3>
            <p>
              Plumbers, electricians, landscapers, contractors—if you serve your
              local community, you need a website that shows up when people
              search for your services.
            </p>
            <p>
              Most of your customers find you through Google searches like
              "plumber near me" or "electrician in [city]." A well-optimized
              website helps you show up in those searches and makes it easy for
              customers to call, email, or book appointments.
            </p>
            <p>
              I'll build you a mobile-friendly site with clear contact
              information, service area details, and all the technical SEO work
              needed to rank in local searches. No complicated dashboards or
              technical jargon—just a website that brings you customers.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li class="card flow">
            <h3>Retail & E-commerce</h3>
            <p>
              Small shops, boutiques, and online stores that need a professional
              web presence without the complexity and cost of enterprise
              platforms.
            </p>
            <p>
              Whether you're selling handmade goods, running a local boutique,
              or starting an online store, you need a website that showcases
              your products and makes purchasing simple.
            </p>
            <p>
              I can integrate payment processing, inventory management, and
              shipping calculations—or keep it simple with a product showcase
              and contact form. Your site will work seamlessly on phones and
              tablets, where most shopping happens.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li class="card flow">
            <h3>Professional Services</h3>
            <p>
              Consultants, lawyers, accountants, real estate agents—establish
              credibility and make it easy for clients to find and contact you.
            </p>
            <p>
              Your website is often the first impression potential clients have
              of your practice. A professional, well-designed site builds trust
              and positions you as an expert in your field.
            </p>
            <p>
              I'll create a site that highlights your credentials, showcases
              testimonials, explains your services clearly, and makes it
              effortless for clients to schedule consultations or reach out. No
              stock photos or generic content—your expertise deserves better.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li class="card flow">
            <h3>Restaurants & Hospitality</h3>
            <p>
              Showcase your menu, take reservations, and keep customers informed
              about hours, events, and special offers.
            </p>
            <p>
              Customers want to see your menu, check your hours, and make
              reservations before they visit. A fast, mobile-friendly website
              answers these questions instantly and drives more foot traffic.
            </p>
            <p>
              I'll build a site with an easy-to-update menu, online reservation
              integration if needed, photo galleries of your space and dishes,
              and clear location and parking information. Update specials and
              hours yourself without calling a developer.
            </p>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <div class="section spot-color-primary">
        <Curve />
        <div class="section__inner">
          <article class="flow region wrapper">
            <h2>No Vendor Lock-In</h2>
            <p>
              Your content, your domain, your customer data—it all stays yours.
              Unlike Squarespace or Wix, you're not trapped in a proprietary
              platform that controls your business.
            </p>
            <p>
              I build sites on open web standards, which means your content is
              portable and you're not subject to arbitrary price hikes, forced
              feature restrictions, or platform policy changes that could hurt
              your business overnight.
            </p>
            <p>
              If your needs change or you want to move in a different direction,
              you won't have to rebuild from scratch. Your digital presence is
              yours to control.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
        <Curve />
      </div>

      <article class="flow region wrapper">
        <h2>Ready to Get Started?</h2>
        <p>
          Let's talk about your project. I'll give you straight answers, honest
          timelines, and a plan that actually fits your budget.
        </p>
        <p>
          <a href="/contact">Start Your Website — $0 Down</a>
        </p>
      </article>
    </main>

    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>
